OL,3,AMadagascar ex-Senate chief sentenced to
OL,4,Ahard labour over deadly Gen Z protest
OL,5,Acrackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FMadagascar's former Senate president
OL,8,Fhas been sentenced to 10 years of hard
OL,9,Flabour over his alleged role in the
OL,10,Fviolent crackdown on youth-led protests
OL,11,Fthat helped bring down the previous
OL,12,Fgovernment last year.
OL,14,FRichard Ravalomanana, a retired general
OL,15,Fand close ally of former President
OL,16,FAndry Rajoelina, was found guilty of
OL,17,Fcomplicity in murder by a court in the
OL,18,Fcapital, Antananarivo, on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
