OL,3,AMadagascar ex-Senate chief sentenced to
OL,4,Ahard labour over deadly Gen Z protest
OL,5,Acrackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors accused him of giving
OL,8,Finstructions to security forces to use
OL,9,Fviolence against demonstrators during
OL,10,Fthe so-called Gen Z protests in
OL,11,FSeptember and October 2025.
OL,13,FRavalomanana denied the allegations and
OL,14,Fsaid he would appeal against the
OL,15,Fjudgement.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
